### Requests for the Visual Studio / Rider HTTP client. Run the API first (Development profile).
@base = http://localhost:5080
@key = dev_key_change_me

### Successful card payment
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-1

{ "amountMinorUnits": 2500, "currency": "EUR", "method": "Card", "merchantReference": "order-1001" }

### Send the same request again: same payment, header Idempotent-Replayed: true
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-1

{ "amountMinorUnits": 2500, "currency": "EUR", "method": "Card", "merchantReference": "order-1001" }

### Declined (amount ends in 13)
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-declined-1

{ "amountMinorUnits": 1013, "currency": "EUR", "method": "Card", "merchantReference": "order-1002" }

### Retries: the provider fails twice, then succeeds (amount ends in 42)
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-retry-1

{ "amountMinorUnits": 1042, "currency": "EUR", "method": "Card", "merchantReference": "order-1003" }

### Failover: primary provider is down, the backup takes over (amount ends in 99)
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-failover-1

{ "amountMinorUnits": 1099, "currency": "EUR", "method": "Card", "merchantReference": "order-1004" }

### Pending: the result arrives by webhook (amount ends in 77). Copy providerPaymentId from the response.
POST {{base}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-pending-1

{ "amountMinorUnits": 5077, "currency": "EUR", "method": "Card", "merchantReference": "order-1005" }

### Simulate the provider's signed webhook for the pending payment (Development only)
POST {{base}}/dev/simulate-webhook
Content-Type: application/json

{ "provider": "acmepay", "providerPaymentId": "PASTE_PROVIDER_PAYMENT_ID", "type": "payment.succeeded" }

### Get a payment
GET {{base}}/payments/PASTE_PAYMENT_ID
X-Api-Key: {{key}}

### Partial refund
POST {{base}}/payments/PASTE_PAYMENT_ID/refunds
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{key}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-refund-1

{ "amountMinorUnits": 1000 }
